// The last rung of REQUIREMENTS #5's ladder: ore you mined becomes metal you
// can craft with.
//
// One input, no pattern -- which is why smelting recipes live in their own
// directory rather than alongside the shaped crafting recipes: the matcher is
// a different shape, not a special case of the same one.
SmeltRecipe(
    name:   "cubara:iron_ingot",
    input:  "cubara:raw_iron",
    output: (item: "cubara:iron_ingot", count: 1),
    ticks:  200,
)
